OL,3,GNEWSAZoo says goodbye to 'most
OL,4,Aincredible' alligator
OL,5,
OL,6,FA crocodile zoo has said goodbye to one
OL,7,Fof its "most incredible" inhabitants.
OL,9,FAmerican alligator Albert joined
OL,10,FCrocodiles of the World in Brize
OL,11,FNorton, Oxfordshire, as an adult in
OL,12,FMarch 2013.
OL,14,FSince then it said he had been a
OL,15,F"familiar face beyond the zoo",
OL,16,Ffeaturing in television programmes and
OL,17,Fcrocodilian research.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
