OL,3,GNEWSAZoo says goodbye to 'most
OL,4,Aincredible' alligator
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe zoo said in a post on social media
OL,7,Fon Saturday that after a CT scan, which
OL,8,Fshowed he was "seriously unwell", staff
OL,9,F"made the incredibly difficult decision
OL,10,Fto put him to sleep".
